flowchart TD
    AST[Typed lvalue or array designator] --> ADDR[Object address and target offset]
    ADDR --> IR[Typed load, store, offset, or member IR]
    IR --> CHECK[IR storage and stride verifier]
    CHECK --> VM[Owned byte object and pointer metadata]
    CHECK --> X86[Declared-width x86 memory operation]
    VM --> BOUNDS[Bounds, alignment, initialized bytes, const checks]
    ENTRY[Block entry] --> FRESH[Fresh object identity]
    FRESH --> VM
    EXIT[Scope exit, break, continue, return] --> DEAD[Retired object]
    DEAD --> LIFETIME[Expired pointer classification]
    LIST[Brace initializer and designator path] --> PLAN[Source ordered subobject initialization plan]
    PLAN --> ZERO[Omitted subobject zero effects]
    PLAN --> INIT[Scalar or object initialization effects]
    ZERO --> CHECK
    INIT --> CHECK
    PLAN --> STATIC[Global bytes and pointer relocations]
    VALUE[Aggregate assignment, conditional, comma result] --> SNAPSHOT[Typed automatic object snapshot]
    SNAPSHOT --> COPY[Copy bytes, initialization state, pointer metadata]
    COPY --> FREEZE[Freeze completed temporary]
    FREEZE --> VM
    FULL[Full expression ends] --> DEAD
